/**
 * Event-sourced input logger for polished recording preprocessing.
 *
 * Instead of polling cursor position, we log events precisely when
 * xdotool commands complete, capturing the ground truth of what happened.
 */



/**
 * X11 cursor name to CursorType mapping.
 * Based on common X11 cursor names from xdotool and X11 cursor themes.
 */
